From: szybkoiwyraznie-rgb
 <321798940+szybkoiwyraznie-rgb@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 09:38:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ratings sync, instant display, production v1 for legacy
 jingles, immediate ZIP

Product decisions from the owner (ADR 0002):
a. best-jingles ZIP must exist immediately (unencrypted without the
   JINGLE_ZIP_PASSWORD secret): build_best_zip.py now uses the unified
   versions schema and skips unrated versions instead of crashing, so the
   release workflow succeeds from the first synced rating
b. the five legacy jingles (stories 1-5) are production v1 versions:
   data/versions.json now seeds them with full project descriptions
c. ratings display instantly on the device (localStorage in story.js and
   app.js) and permanently everywhere after the automatic sync
d. every feedback issue rating must be written into data/versions.json:
   new scripts/sync_ratings.py plus the Sync ratings workflow that runs on
   every feedback issue and republishes Pages and the ZIP; agents verify
   sync in every loop (AGENTS.md rule 12, workflow step 0.5)

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
